  m_Name: Emberbloom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Emberbloom
  tab: 2
  picture: {fileID: 1230072411722605195, guid: 13b5fced25b9bd34799621076e75ef35, type: 3}
  loreText: "Emberbloom grows where the old monuments once drew their power, as if
    the ground still remembers the fire that passed through it. Travellers say the
    petals glow faintly at night, like coals that refuse to go out.\n\nHealers grind
    the petals into their tinctures to \u201Cwake the blood\u201D. A single bloom
    is said to keep a wanderer warm through a winter night. Picking one with bare
    hands leaves the fingers tingling for hours.\n\nNever pick the last bloom of
    a patch. The old village folk say it carries the warmth for all the others."
  startsUnlocked: 1
